WEBVTT

00:15:29.942 --> 00:15:32.577
and I'm asking you not to stop either.

00:15:33.795 --> 00:15:39.271
We owe future generations
a world free of sexual violence.

00:15:40.121 --> 00:15:42.216
I believe we can build that world.

00:15:43.202 --> 00:15:44.352
Do you?

00:15:45.684 --> 00:15:46.835
Thank you.

00:15:46.859 --> 00:15:53.859
(Applause)